message: "If you use this checklist or its figures in research, please cite it as below."
title: "How image measures lie quietly: nineteen silent failure modes of hand-built image measures"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Parrish
    given-names: Russell
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0008-9781-7995
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-10-29
license: MIT
url: https://www.parallaxmetrology.com/how_measures_lie.html
repository-code: https://github.com/parallaxmetrology/how-measures-lie
keywords: [image analysis, measurement, validation, normalisation, null models, reproducibility, failure modes]
abstract: >
  Nineteen ways a hand-built image measure returns a plausible, wrong number without raising
  an error, drawn from the lab log of a deterministic painting-structure instrument, each with
  a case and a check. Thirteen are reproduced on synthetic images by the scripts in this repository.
